{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "31520e44-7307-897b-bd15-b3b623b021cf",
  "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:00:21-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Moira Donovan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:57:14-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Tony. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:57:18-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon. My name is Moira Donovan. I was told to ask for someone patient, and I hope that is you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:57:25-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll do my best, Ms. Donovan. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:57:29-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I received a notice in the mail. It says my water will be shut off. I do not think this is right, and I want to know exactly how much time I have."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:57:40-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, let me pull it up. Can you read me the date at the top of the notice, and whatever it says about a deadline?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:57:49-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The notice is dated November twenty-fourth. It says payment is due within fourteen days. That is what it says. I count that as December eighth. Is my counting correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:57:59-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fourteen days from the twenty-fourth lands on the eighth, yes, that's a Monday. So you've got until then, a bit under a week from today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:58:08-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A week. I see. I will tell you why I am annoyed. The bill is very high. I had a plumber here two weeks ago because of a leak in the kitchen pipe. He fixed it. I kept the receipt. The high reading was from the leak, and I should not pay for water that went into nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:58:27-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, that's a fair thing to raise. The receipt matters. If you can send in a copy of it, or bring it to the office, the billing staff can look at whether the leak qualifies for an adjustment. I can note on the account that you've got repair paperwork."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:58:43-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please note it. I have the receipt in front of me. It is dated November eighteenth. The plumber wrote what he repaired. I want that written down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:58:52-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, November eighteenth, kitchen pipe repair, receipt on hand. I've put that in the account notes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:58:58-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Now I have another question, and I want a precise answer. I cannot always come during office hours. If I need to pay, is there a drop box where I can leave a payment after the office is closed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:59:11-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, there's a payment drop box at City Hall. It's available outside of office hours. Just put a check or money order in an envelope, with your account number written on it, and don't leave cash."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:59:23-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do not leave cash in a box. I will write a check. Where is the box exactly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:59:30-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's by the main entrance of City Hall on Broadway. You'll see it near the front doors. And if you're mailing it, give it a few days to arrive so it's there before the eighth."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:59:42-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Then I will put the receipt copy in an envelope as well and bring both. Should I pay the whole amount, or wait for the adjustment?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:59:51-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. I'd bring the receipt in first or at the same time, and ask the billing office about holding the shutoff while they review it. Can I take a callback number so someone can confirm that with you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T13:00:04-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is four zero one, five five five, zero one five one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T13:00:09-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-one. Perfect. Someone from billing will call you back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T13:00:13-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. You were patient. That is what I was told to look for."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T13:00:18-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Happy to help, Ms. Donovan. You take care."
    }
  ],
